https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20632  confirmed


DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend917_13;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend917_13;
USE repro_databend917_13;

CREATE TABLE src (
  id BIGINT,
  a ARRAY(BIGINT NULL),
  v VARIANT,
  s VARCHAR
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO src VALUES
  (1, [1,2], '{"x":1}', NULL),
  (2, NULL,  '{"x":2}', 'abc'),
  (3, [],    '{"x":3}', '');

CREATE TABLE l (
  id BIGINT,
  s VARCHAR,
  v VARIANT
) ENGINE=MEMORY;

CREATE TABLE r (
  id BIGINT,
  a ARRAY(BIGINT NULL)
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO l SELECT id, s, v FROM src;
INSERT INTO r SELECT id, a FROM src;

SELECT a, s, a
FROM src
WHERE ((s IS NULL) <> (a IS NULL))
  AND ('' LIKE s)
  AND ('' LIKE s);

SELECT x.a, x.s, x.a
FROM (
  SELECT l.id, r.a, l.v, l.s
  FROM l
  JOIN (
    SELECT id, JSON_OBJECT('vp', id) AS payload
    FROM r
  ) jp
    ON l.id = CAST(jp.payload:vp AS BIGINT)
  JOIN r
    ON r.id = CAST(jp.payload:vp AS BIGINT)
) x
WHERE ((x.s IS NULL) <> (x.a IS NULL))
  AND ('' LIKE x.s)
  AND ('' LIKE x.s);

原始单表查询：
0 rows

重构后的多表查询：
a     s      a
NULL  abc    NULL

原始查询执行计划：
TableScan
├── table: default.repro_databend917_13.src
├── output columns: [a, s]
├── read rows: 3
└── push downs:
    [(NOT is_not_null(src.s)) <> (NOT is_not_null(src.a))
     AND like('', src.s)]

LIKE 和 IS NULL 异或条件一起在单表扫描阶段求值。
对于 id=2，like('', 'abc') 为 false，整个 AND 条件为 false，行被过滤。

重构查询执行计划核心结构：
HashJoin
├── output columns: [r.a, l.s]
├── join type: INNER
├── filters:
│   [(NOT is_not_null(l.s)) <> (NOT is_not_null(r.a))]
├── HashJoin(Build)
│   ├── build: TableScan l
│   │   └── filter: is_true(like('', l.s))
│   └── probe:
│       EvalScalar
│       └── TableScan r
│           └── expression: object_construct('vp', r.id)
└── TableScan r
    └── join key: r.id

LIKE 被下推到 l 的 TableScan 后，下推谓词没有保持原 WHERE 中 '' LIKE s 的三值布尔语义，导致 l.s='abc' 这一行本应被 LIKE 过滤掉，却进入了 JOIN。
之后再与 r.a=NULL 组合，顶层 HashJoin 只检查 (s IS NULL) <> (a IS NULL)，于是这个组合被保留，产生了原单表查询没有的额外行。